      "writtenOn": "2022-10-05T17:08:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about adding a new `VmEventType` variant and plumbing it through to a new exit status, so that virtualizationservice can use that rather than parsing the logs?",
      "revId": "b54d6d0eceaa73373baa75f815423fd7e605a0b2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
